    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d366">

                <pb facs="0610" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v01/pg514"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Press Release Issued by the Department of State on
                        November 2, 1937</hi><anchor n="17" xml:id="d366-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1937-11-02">November 2, 1937</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>The latest figures available on the number of American nationals who have been
                    evacuated from China and the number of those remaining have come from the
                    commander in chief of the Asiatic Fleet at Shanghai. They are as follows: <table
                        cols="4" rows="16">
                        <row>
                            <cell cols="2">American nationals evacuated to October 29 from—</cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Shanghai</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2,046</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Peiping-Tientsin area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">510</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Chefoo-Tsingtao area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1,193</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Yangtze River ports and interior</cell>
                            <cell role="num">352</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Foochow-Amoy-Swatow area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">93</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Kwangtung, Kwangsi, Kweichow Provinces, and Hainan Island</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom" role="num">367</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Total evacuated</cell>
                            <cell role="num">4,561</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell cols="2">American nationals remaining at—</cell>
                            <cell/>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Shanghai</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2,293</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Peiping-Tientsin area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1,055</cell>
                        </row>
                        <pb facs="0611" n="515" xml:id="pg515"/>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Chefoo-Tsingtao area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">676</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Yangtze River ports and interior</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1,156</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Foochow-Amoy-Swatow area</cell>
                            <cell role="num">216</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Kwangtung, Kwangsi, Kweichow Provinces, and Hainan Island</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom" role="num">406</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell>Total remaining</cell>
                            <cell role="num">5,802</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
